sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant A as A Rental Owner
    participant D as D07 Verified Event
    participant B as B Parking Owner
    participant U as Shared UnitOfWork
    Student->>A: requestPickup(holdId)
    A->>A: HANDOVER_PENDING, keep vehicle claim
    Note over A,D: No database lock while waiting for physical evidence
    D-->>A: verified departure event (sourceId,eventId)
    A->>U: executeAtomic(pickup effect)
    U->>B: recordDeparture(verifiedEvent,context)
    U->>A: consume hold and open RentalTrip
    U->>D: update verified vehicle location projection
    U-->>A: committed effect or rollback
    Student->>A: requestReturn(tripId,hubId)
    A->>B: checkReception(tripId,hubId,rightId,asOf)
    D-->>A: verified physical arrival event
    A->>U: executeAtomic(return effect)
    U->>B: recordArrival(event,rightId,context)
    alt physical and authorized reception
        U->>A: close trip, release rental claim
    else unauthorized arrival or unknown
        U->>A: remain ASSISTANCE_PENDING
        U->>D: open or link incident
    end
    U-->>A: outcome with receipt
